{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01791","headline":"杂曲歌辞 行路难 · 韦应物","name":"杂曲歌辞 行路难","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"荆山之白玉兮。\n良工雕琢双环连，月蚀中央镜心穿。\n故人赠妾初相结，恩在环中寻不绝。\n人情厚薄苦须臾，昔似连环今似玦。\n连环可碎不可离，如何物在人自移。\n上客勿遽欢，听妾歌路难。\n傍人见环环可怜，不知中有长恨端。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01791.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01791","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}